WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.328
Hi, I'm Calmbot.

00:00:03.528 --> 00:00:13.536
I help parents with behavior and routines. I help you build calm mornings, easy bedtimes, and simple routines that stick.

00:00:13.736 --> 00:00:18.704
For example, ask me: make me a morning routine for my six-year-old.
